        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "J1.14 (SDA) ↔ SPI_MOSI ↔ U5.12"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The EPD SPI_MOSI line is tied to a ground pin, so the display cannot receive data and the display interface is effectively shorted to ground.",
