          "source": "schematic",
          "quote": "EPD_Driver sheet: J7 pin 13 -> NET0035; SkylabModule sheet: U10 pin 18 USB+ -> NET0035."
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "J1.13 (SCL) ↔ SPI_CLK ↔ U5.11"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The EPD SPI clock is merged with the module USB+ pin, preventing normal display operation and interfering with any USB data function.",
